# Version 2.0.1.0 is the shop credit ledger rebuilt on Vite, React, TypeScript, Tailwind and Zustand.
# It replaced 1.2.5.0 at the live link on 27 November 2026; the 1.x code no longer runs.
# It has the nine must-do items of the brief, the tester hooks, six bonus items (overdue list, edit and
# delete, CSV export, search, UPI pay link, Hindi and Telugu), light and dark, a pay link in every reminder
# for money owed (a demo UPI id until the shop sets its own), the carry-over of a ledger saved by 1.x,
# delete with Undo and an offline copy. Reading the amount from a screenshot is not built.
# Balances are computed from entries only; customer data stays in the browser.
# What 1.x had and 2.0 does not is listed in PRD.md, section 7.
